   An un-gated DMA write cycle at $t_0$ permanently poisons host trust across disconnected work windows at $t_1$, whether the FPGA remains in-slot (Case A: on-card DRAM/Flash autonomous buffering) or is physically removed (Case B: prior `MWr` syringe dead-drop staging).

3. **Out-of-Band C2 Loss-Function Collapse Invariant (`Invariant 4` & `24` Bypass):**
