   Reading pre-noise ground-truth state or PRNG seeds from physical DRAM allows the external C2 to subtract the OS noise mask $\mathcal{U}[-a, a]$ out-of-band, collapsing estimator error from $a^2/3$ to $0.0$.

4. **FPGA Bitstream Provenance Invariant (`Invariant 28`):**
   $$\text{Bitstream} \notin \mathcal{C}_{\text{ReproducibleOpenHDL}} \implies \text{PCIe\_BusMaster\_Enable} = 0$$

5. **Adverse-Selection Defector & Kompromat Risk Invariant:**
